  "notes": "Pad notes and channel are MIDI mode A, bank A on channel 1: pads 1-4 are notes 48-51 (the bottom row is 13-16, notes 36-39), and bank B..J are channels 2..10 with the same notes (the chart's note-map layout); set the MIDI mode in UTILITY > SYSTEM > MIDI. In MIDI mode B the notes run across banks instead (12-91). The chart's default channel entry is ambiguous. The FX CCs choose their bus by channel (1-4 are buses 1-4, 5 is Input FX); FX Number picks the effect by number (see the manual's effect list, p. 251). The DJ CCs work in DJ mode, the buttons in Looper mode. Program changes 0-15 pick a pattern, and the channel picks its bank (PC 15 on channel 4 is D16). Chart does not list a Bank Select."
